1000 REM *** SALVO BY LARRY SIEGEL
1010 REM *** LAST REVISION 6/9/73
1020 REM *** CHECKED OUT ON RSTS/E BY DAVE AHL, DIGITAL
1030 REM ***
1040 DIM A(10,10),B(10,10),C(7),D(7)
1045 DIM E(12),F(12),G(12),H(12),K(10,10)
1050 LET Z8=0
1060 FOR W=1 TO 12
1070 LET E(W)=-1
1080 LET H(W)=-1
1090 NEXT W
1100 FOR X=1 TO 10
1110 FOR Y=1 TO 10
1120 LET B(X,Y)=0
